                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Iron Storm reminds me so much of Return to Castle Wolfenstein with its own mix of identity and DNA splashed into it! The story is okay the game play is really fun to play! The first half of the game is primarily just running and gunning. The last half of the game plus ending becomes very stealthy tactical and complex on trying to figure out what you need to do and where to go and consistently backtracking especially for the 3rd to last mission and the last mission. Don't get me started with the second to last mission which is the train mission the amount of BS that you have to deal with shooting torrents is ridiculous you literally have to head glitch every single door to be able to kill every single one in the train and there's probably like hundred of them.\r\n\r\nI Give This Game A Iron Brain / 10",
